Identify the latest C2 communication. What is this type of activity called?
Answer: Beaconing

Use union to build a complete timeline from first phishing email to last C2 beacon. How many minutes passed between the first phishing email and the attacker's last action?
Not going to lie to you, I needed some help here, but this is what I got:
let phishing_email =
Email
| where sender has "noreply@whiskersandwonders-hr.com"
| project timestamp;
let attacker_activity =
union
(
    ProxyEvents
    | where url has_any ("api-sync-updates.top", "update-cdn-service.xyz")
    | project timestamp
);
union phishing_email, attacker_activity
| summarize first_seen=min(timestamp), last_seen=max(timestamp)
| extend minutes_elapsed = datetime_diff('minute', last_seen, first_seen)
Answer: 7505
